wouldYouCommentHere: yes
Code:
```typescript
const MAX_RETRIES = 3;
```
Original:
```typescript
// Retry budget agreed with the upstream team; they rate-limit at 10 req/s.
```
Regenerated:
```text
Retry up to three times before giving up on the upstream call.
```

